<title>GERMANY: Kloeckner&amp;Co to restructure, focus on PCs, steel.</title>
<headline>Kloeckner&amp;Co to restructure, focus on PCs, steel.</headline>
<dateline>DUISBURG, Germany 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German trading and services group Kloeckner &amp; Co AG, a subsidiary of diversified industry group Viag AG, said on Monday it planned to sell two of its five divisions and refocus its business.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that its future business would concentrate on personal computer products through its unit Computer 2000 and on steel trading activities.</p>
</text>
